    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/589ab2a7c597912695d0791b01131d8c.poster.avif?t=1618192413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/589ab2a7c597912695d0791b01131d8c.webm?t=1618192413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/589ab2a7c597912695d0791b01131d8c.mp4?t=1618192413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Eternal world with thrilling strategic battles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter Soulz for the ultimate strategic battle!<br></li><li>Simple but special and deep dual</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/fa6f3c33dff5286295e6645c29a3381d.poster.avif?t=1618192413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/fa6f3c33dff5286295e6645c29a3381d.webm?t=1618192413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/fa6f3c33dff5286295e6645c29a3381d.mp4?t=1618192413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle in the Dynamic Battlefield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use all the strategies and tactics you have prepared to attack!<br></li><li>Command the legends to defeat the enemy, occupy the headquarter, and acquire points!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/795dd2d2fb95469b5393611783d5103b.poster.avif?t=1618192413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/743170/extras/795dd2d